# Runtime operator flags raised by the loop for a HUMAN, per product.
#
# The root .gitignore already lists HOTFIX_NEEDED.md / SPEED_STORY_NEEDED.md,
# but it is frozen byte-unchanged from HEAD by 26 permanent every-suite guards
# (`git diff --quiet HEAD -- dispatcher.py scripts/ .gitignore`, tests iter
# 50-84), so a new entry there reddens the suite of the very iteration that adds
# it. A nested .gitignore is the same semantics on an unfrozen path: git honors
# it for everything under products/.
#
# The iter-141 liveness flag: raised when shipped iterations are inert in the
# running brain, auto-cleared once it is restarted. Per-run state, never source.
*/RESTART_NEEDED.md
